# Local test and build output. `node_modules`, `dist` and `test-results`
# are covered by the repository root; these two were not.
#
# F68 in the production review found 29 Playwright artifacts committed to
# the portal repo — 16 of them failure screenshots and trace.zips from a
# red run. `playwright-report/` here is the same shape and was one bad run
# away from the same outcome.
coverage/
playwright-report/

# Screenshot output. `app-shots.spec.ts` writes a picture of every main
# screen for review, and `landing-shot*.spec.ts` writes product shots;
# both render whatever the run produced, so they are evidence of a
# review rather than an artefact to keep. E5.
shots/
landing-shots/
